WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.366
Classical texts describe four goals

2
00:00:02.366 --> 00:00:03.557
of human life.

3
00:00:03.557 --> 00:00:05.396
The purusharthas.

4
00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:07.396
Dharma, right conduct.

5
00:00:07.396 --> 00:00:08.678
Artha, wealth.

6
00:00:08.678 --> 00:00:10.001
Kama, desire.

7
00:00:10.001 --> 00:00:10.957
And moksha,

8
00:00:10.957 --> 00:00:12.255
liberation.

9
00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:14.330
The four life stages: student

10
00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.654
and householder,

11
00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:18.028
retreat and renunciation.

12
00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:20.058
Add karma and rebirth,

13
00:00:20.058 --> 00:00:21.370
and the three debts,

14
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.478
or rinas.

15
00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.327
Your turn.

16
00:00:24.327 --> 00:00:26.462
Which means liberation?
